      "prompt_example": "<s>[INST] You are a causal diagram expert evaluating the quality of a causal explanation.\n\nSOURCE: Size of social network\nTARGET: Informal care\nRELATIONSHIP: NEGATIVE\nEXPLANATION: A larger social network could lead to a diffusion of responsibility, where each member assumes someone else will provide informal care, ultimately resulting in less actual care being given. Additionally, with more social contacts, individuals may experience increased social fatigue, reducing their willingness or ability to offer informal support. Thus, as the size of the social network increases, the amount of informal care might decrease.\n\nAssess whether the causal reasoning is logically sound based on:\n- Plausibility: is there a clear causal mechanism?\n- Temporality: does the cause precede the effect?\n- Strength: is the relationship substantial?\n- Coherence: is the reasoning internally consistent?\n\nRespond with VERDICT only. [/INST]",
